  <item>
    <title>34.《寂静岭f》神仙打架凡人遭殃！feat《元味电波》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6909f51caf4fc00da7181d53</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6909f51caf4fc00da7181d53</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 04 Nov 2025 17:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，这一期是蜉蝣与《元味电波》的大川的联动集。</span></p><span></span><p><span>万众期待的寂静岭系列新作《寂静岭f》终于发布了，这次游戏的舞台从美国来到了1960年代的日本，主角也换成了一个日本女高中生，游戏围绕每个人自身的现实困境，无论男女给我们讲述了一个与自我和解的故事。本期节目我们将从游戏本身的剧情，动作设计，关卡设计，以及游戏外作者想表达的思想等跟大家好好聊聊《寂静岭f》这部久违的正统续作。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们在上一期赛博忏悔中</span><strong><span>以两位女性玩家</span></strong><span>的视角也聊到了《寂静岭f》，如果你有兴趣请点击↓</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68df775f8e321a0d6fc7fb87" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68df775f8e321a0d6fc7fb87"><span>32.赛博忏悔第五夜-狐狸男是好好还是坏坏？</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴⏰：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 寂静岭f：游戏热度与多结局探讨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="329">05:29</a> 游戏角色建模的争议与评价</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="797">13:17</a> 寂静岭战斗系统革新与玩家体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1136">18:56</a> 寂静岭游戏体验与地图设计改进</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1338">22:18</a> 寂静岭f与日本文化的融合</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1763">29:23</a> 日式恐怖游戏《零系列》的多周目体验与文化背景探讨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2053">34:13</a> 寂静岭游戏解谜与恐怖氛围体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2472">41:12</a> 60年代日本背景下的游戏反思与彩蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2634">43:54</a> 游戏角色背景与互动解析</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2841">47:21</a> 角色性格与关系解析：内向咲子与虚伪凛子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3051">50:51</a> 昭和家庭与自我觉醒：游戏剧情探讨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3242">54:02</a> 昭和时代的小镇与性别偏见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3508">58:28</a> 小镇奇遇与里世界探索</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3935">01:05:35</a> 里世界游戏体验与怪物吐槽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4163">01:09:23</a> 游戏里世界与角色情感纠葛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4550">01:15:50</a> 里世界任务与三角关系揭秘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4826">01:20:26</a> 里世界试炼：雏子的痛苦蜕变与自我告别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5118">01:25:18</a> 深水家解谜与家庭幻影对决</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5386">01:29:46</a> 里世界与表世界的交错战斗：厨子的复仇之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5779">01:36:19</a> 一周目结局揭秘：长谊神功命案与红色药丸之谜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5876">01:37:56</a> 药物引发的幻觉与悲剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6052">01:40:52</a> 寂静岭系列神秘力量与狐狸娶亲结局解析</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6081">01:41:21</a> 灵刀与戎之丘的信仰变迁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6329">01:45:29</a> 少男少女情感纠葛与命运抉择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6651">01:50:51</a> 细思极恐的结局：游戏中的多重结局分析</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6941">01:55:41</a> 游戏结局解析与暗线揭秘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7171">01:59:31</a> 游戏《寂静岭》深层探讨：性别困境与社会枷锁</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎥制作组：</span></p><span></span><p><span>监制：大川</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：大川</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：大川</span></p><span></span><p><span>设计：大川</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎤主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>元味电波-大川</span></p><span></span><p><span>食道癌疗养院-蜉蝣</span></p><span></span><p><span>✨我们的节目已上线苹果/谷歌/Spotify/小宇宙/QQ音乐/豆瓣等平台</span></p><span></span><p><span>搜索「食道癌疗养院」都可以进入两个亚比的精神世界👀🔥</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲-迷い歌</span></p><span></span><p><span>ごきげん麗しゅう❤</span></p>]]></description>
